  "claim": "Of the two films, Summer Wars and The Secret of Kells, the 2009 animated film that Mike McFarland voiced in, is from Japan.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Summer Wars. Sentence: Summer Wars (Japanese: サマーウォーズ , Hepburn: Samā Wōzu ) is a 2009 Japanese animated science fiction film directed by Mamoru Hosoda, animated by Madhouse and distributed by Warner Bros.\nPage: The Secret of Kells. Sentence: The Secret of Kells is a 2009 French-Belgian-Irish animated fantasy film animated by Cartoon Saloon that premiered on 8 February 2009 at the 59th Berlin International Film Festival.\nPage: Mike McFarland. Sentence: He has voice directed on multiple Funimation titles including \"Dragon Ball\", \"Fullmetal Alchemist\", \"Case Closed\", and \"Attack on Titan\", the \"Rebuild of Evangelion\" films, and \"Summer Wars\".",
