        "original_id": "b7f6f880-67d4-5b3b-92f5-94ca5a61734f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Summer Wars, The Secret of Kells, Rebuild of Evangelion, Dragon Ball, Fullmetal Alchemist, Case Closed, Attack on Titan\n- People: Mamoru Hosoda, Mike McFarland\n- Companies: Madhouse, Warner Bros., Cartoon Saloon, Funimation\n- Events: 59th Berlin International Film Festival\n- Topics: animated films, voice directing\n\nFacts:\n- Summer Wars is a 2009 Japanese animated science fiction film directed by Mamoru Hosoda, animated by Madhouse, and distributed by Warner Bros.\n- The Secret of Kells is a 2009 French-Belgian-Irish animated fantasy film animated by Cartoon Saloon that premiered on 8 February 2009 at the 59th Berlin International Film Festival.\n- Mike McFarland has voice directed multiple Funimation titles including Dragon Ball, Fullmetal Alchemist, Case Closed, Attack on Titan, the Rebuild of Evangelion films, and Summer Wars.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
